{
  "id": "trig-sub-x2-plus-a2",
  "title": "√(x² + a²)",
  "readMinutes": 10,
  "totalMinutes": 40,
  "prerequisites": ["trig-sub-a2-minus-x2", "trig-integral-tan-sec"],
  "next": ["trig-sub-x2-minus-a2"],
  "related": ["partial-fractions-quadratic", "riemann-sum-notation"],
  "objectives": [
    "看到 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$ 或 $(x^2+a^2)^n$ 且換元配不起來時，會令 $x=a\\tan\\theta$，$\\theta\\in(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2})$。",
    "會用「對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$、斜邊 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$」的三角形換回 $x$。",
    "會積 $\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$ 與 $\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+a^2)^2}$。"
  ],
  "visual": null,
  "concept": [
    {
      "heading": "① 需要的恆等式：$1+\\tan^2\\theta=\\sec^2\\theta$",
      "body": [
        "上一課用 $1-\\sin^2\\theta=\\cos^2\\theta$ 消掉 $a^2-x^2$。這一課是加號，要用 $1+\\tan^2\\theta=\\sec^2\\theta$：令 $x=a\\tan\\theta$，則 $x^2+a^2=a^2\\tan^2\\theta+a^2=a^2\\sec^2\\theta$。",
        "取 $\\theta\\in(-\\frac{\\pi}{2},\\frac{\\pi}{2})$：$\\tan\\theta$ 在這段上走遍所有實數，每個 $x$ 恰好對應一個 $\\theta=\\arctan\\frac{x}{a}$；而且 $\\cos\\theta>0$，$\\sec\\theta>0$，所以 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}=a\\sec\\theta$。",
        "$dx=a\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$。代進去之後通常剩 $\\sec$、$\\tan$ 或 $\\sin$、$\\cos$ 的次方。"
      ],
      "tex": ["x=a\\tan\\theta,\\quad dx=a\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta,\\quad \\sqrt{x^2+a^2}=a\\sec\\theta\\quad\\left(-\\tfrac\\pi2<\\theta<\\tfrac\\pi2\\right)"],
      "collapsible": false
    },
    {
      "heading": "② 換回 $x$ 的三角形",
      "body": [
        "$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{x}{a}$：對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$、斜邊 $\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}$。",
        "$\\sin\\theta=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$，$\\cos\\theta=\\frac{a}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$，$\\sec\\theta=\\frac{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}{a}$。"
      ],
      "collapsible": false
    },
    {
      "heading": "③ 兩個常見結果",
      "body": [
        "$\\int\\frac{dx}{\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}}$：換完是 $\\int\\sec\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\ln|\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta|$，換回 $x$ 得 $\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2})+C$（常數 $-\\ln a$ 併進 $C$；$x+\\sqrt{x^2+a^2}>0$，不用絕對值）。",
        "$\\int\\frac{dx}{(x^2+a^2)^2}$：換完是 $\\frac{1}{a^3}\\int\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$，用半角。〈部分分式 III：不可約二次式〉留下的 $(x^2+1)^2$ 就是這樣處理。"
      ],
      "collapsible": false
    },
    {
      "heading": "④ 分母是 $x^2+px+q$ 時",
      "body": [
        "先配方成 $(x+h)^2+k^2$，令 $u=x+h$，就回到本課的樣子。"
      ],
      "collapsible": false
    }
  ],
  "workedExamples": [
    {
      "title": "$\\int\\sec\\theta$ 再換回來",
      "prompt": "$\\int\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "令 $x=\\tan\\theta$，$dx=\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$\\sqrt{x^2+1}=\\sec\\theta$。",
        "$\\int\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int\\sec\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\ln|\\sec\\theta+\\tan\\theta|+C$。",
        "三角形：$\\tan\\theta=x$，$\\sec\\theta=\\sqrt{x^2+1}$。",
        "答案：$\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\ln(x+\\sqrt{x^2+1})+C$",
      "claim": "D(ln(x+sqrt(x^2+1))) == 1/sqrt(x^2+1)"
    },
    {
      "title": "平方在分母",
      "prompt": "$\\int\\frac{1}{(x^2+1)^2}\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "令 $x=\\tan\\theta$，$dx=\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$(x^2+1)^2=\\sec^4\\theta$。",
        "$\\int\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec^4\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int\\cos^2\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\frac{\\theta}{2}+\\frac{\\sin 2\\theta}{4}=\\frac{\\theta+\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta}{2}$。",
        "三角形：$\\sin\\theta\\cos\\theta=\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}\\cdot\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}=\\frac{x}{x^2+1}$；$\\theta=\\arctan x$。",
        "答案：$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan x+\\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\right)+C$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\arctan x+\\frac{x}{x^2+1}\\right)+C$",
      "claim": "D((atan(x)+x/(1+x^2))/2) == 1/(x^2+1)^2"
    },
    {
      "title": "定積分",
      "prompt": "$\\int_0^{\\sqrt{3}}\\frac{1}{(x^2+1)^{3/2}}\\,dx$",
      "steps": [
        "令 $x=\\tan\\theta$，$dx=\\sec^2\\theta\\,d\\theta$，$(x^2+1)^{3/2}=\\sec^3\\theta$。",
        "上下限：$x=0\\to\\theta=0$；$x=\\sqrt{3}\\to\\theta=\\frac{\\pi}{3}$。",
        "$\\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\frac{\\sec^2\\theta}{\\sec^3\\theta}\\,d\\theta=\\int_0^{\\pi/3}\\cos\\theta\\,d\\theta=\\sin\\frac{\\pi}{3}=\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$。"
      ],
      "answer": "$\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$",
      "claim": "INT(1/(x^2+1)^(3/2),0,sqrt(3)) == sqrt(3)/2"
    }
  ],
  "pitfalls": [
    "加號的根號也用 $x=a\\sin\\theta$：$a^2+a^2\\sin^2\\theta$ 不是完全平方。",
    "$dx$ 寫成 $a\\sec\\theta\\,d\\theta$，漏了平方。",
    "三角形邊放錯：$\\tan\\theta=\\frac{x}{a}$ 是「對邊 $x$、鄰邊 $a$」。",
    "外面有 $x$ 可以配的（例如 $\\frac{x}{\\sqrt{x^2+1}}$）也用三角代換。"
  ],
